  "content": "\n\n<h1>ModernCraft (Distant Horizons)</h1>\n<p>ModernCraft 是一款基於「Distant Horizons」模組的整合包&nbsp;，內含光影、效能優化模組、更真實的世界生成機制，以及大量 Vanilla+ 改進，旨在將 Minecraft 打造成一款更具現代感的遊戲。</p>\n<p><strong>1.21.1 版本已推出！</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1035716/description_d6e293ad-95b1-4e04-a8d9-33c01d45398b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"686\" height=\"515\"></p>\n<p><em>從村莊眺望的絕美景色，更多圖片請見圖庫</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fscalacube.com%252fp%252f_hosting_server_minecraft%252f4494424\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://scalacube.com/images/banners/modpack.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"142\"></em></a></p>",
